"y":1904,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"방법은","x":369,"y":1904,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"난수","x":484,"y":1904,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"발생기(random","x":566,"y":1904,"width":256,"height":43},{"text":"number","x":835,"y":1905,"width":142,"height":32},{"text":"generator)로서,","x":991,"y":1899,"width":276,"height":48},{"text":"이것은","x":1285,"y":1899,"width":115,"height":40},{"text":"획률","x":1414,"y":1900,"width":81,"height":39},{"text":"분포에","x":1508,"y":1900,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"따라","x":1638,"y":1900,"width":63,"height":40}]},{"text":"서 프로세스, CPU 버스트 시간, 도착, 출발 등을 생성하기 위해 프로그램된다. 분포는","words":[{"text":"서","x":290,"y":1972,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"프로세스,","x":337,"y":1972,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"CPU","x":497,"y":1975,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"버스트","x":598,"y":1972,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"시간,","x":716,"y":1970,"width":77,"height":42},{"text":"도착,","x":810,"y":1970,"width":78,"height":41},{"text":"출발","x":906,"y":1969,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"등을","x":992,"y":1968,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"생성하기","x":1080,"y":1967,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"위해","x":1244,"y":1966,"width":72,"height":40},{"text":"프로그램된다.","x":1336,"y":1966,"width":245,"height":41},{"text":"분포는","x":1600,"y":1967,"width":101,"height":38}]},{"text":"수학적으로[균등(uniform), 지수(exponential), 푸아*(Poisson)], 또는 경험적으로","words":[{"text":"수학적으로[균등(uniform),","x":289,"y":2040,"width":435,"height":43},{"text":"지수(exponential),","x":744,"y":2038,"width":320,"height":47},{"text":"푸아*(Poisson)],","x":1082,"y":2035,"width":318,"height":43},{"text":"또는","x":1421,"y":2035,"width":81,"height":36},{"text":"경험적으로","x":1523,"y":2033,"width":178,"height":39}]},{"text":"정의될 수 있다. 경험적으로분포를 정의하려면, 연구의 대상이 되는 실제 시스템에 대한","words":[{"text":"정의될","x":291,"y":2107,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":402,"y":2107,"width":35,"height":41},{"text":"있다.","x":451,"y":2106,"width":72,"height":41},{"text":"경험적으로분포를","x":540,"y":2106,"width":287,"height":40},{"text"